# Atlas Library — Frontend Environment Configuration
#
# Production / Server deployment template

# Backend API base endpoint
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/api/v1

# Platform Subscription UPI Configuration (Displayed during Library Owner Onboarding / Plan Renewal)
